    "body": "Releasing claim (blocked by build environment, no code pushed).\n\nWhat was checked on `upstream/main` (`31f8d03d`):\n- `crates/app/tests/lathe_field_sim.rs` runs `multi_pass_contour_simulates_with_meridian_parity` without `#[ignore]` (`tolerance: 0.01`, `stepdown: 0.5`, `passes: 3`, `TEXELS = 512_000.0`).\n- `cargo run -p xtask -- gate release --dry-run` currently omits `app heavy: lathe_field_sim` because `crates/app/tests/lathe_field_sim.rs` has no `ignore`.\n\nWhy this run stopped before reproducing/gating:\n- Running `xtask gate test multi_pass_contour_simulates_with_meridian_parity --crate camcraft-app --binary lathe_field_sim --exact` failed compiling `flecs_ecs_sys v0.2.1` (`exit 101`):\n  `sccache: error: failed to create directory /Users/mikekinney/Library/Caches/sccache-pool/preprocessor: Operation not permitted (os error 1)`\n- The environment sets `RUSTC_WRAPPER=/opt/homebrew/bin/sccache`, `SCCACHE_DIR=/Users/mikekinney/Library/Caches/sccache-pool`, and `SCCACHE_SERVER_PORT=4228`; `/Users/mikekinney/Library/Caches/sccache-pool` does not exist and `sccache --show-stats` shows `2515` cache write errors and `18` C/C++ cache errors, so `camcraft-app` cannot compile here under the runner's `sccache` configuration.\n\nNo edits remain; local worktree removed and no branch pushed.\n",
